      "statement": "The resident-cell hard cap CELD_MAX_RESIDENT_CELLS is enforced at admission on a node and defaults to code-unset (which means no wedge behavior); it is the value an operator pins high for loaded nodes (e.g. CELD_MAX_RESIDENT_CELLS=1000).",
